# 🎮 Number Guessing Game

## 📌 Description

Welcome to the **Number Guessing Game**! This is a simple, console-based game where the player has to guess a randomly generated number between 1 and 100. The player has a limited number of attempts (7) to guess the correct number. After each guess, the game provides feedback indicating whether the guess is **too high**, **too low**, or **correct**.

Once the player runs out of attempts, the game reveals the correct number. The player is then asked if they want to play again, allowing for multiple rounds of gameplay.

---

