# 🎮 Color Match Challenge

**A simple, fast-paced reaction game where you match colors to stay in the game!**

## 📌 Game Description

*Color Match Challenge* is a quick and fun reaction game designed to test your reflexes and focus. At the top of the screen, a color is displayed. A circle then appears at the bottom of the screen with a random color. Your task is to click the circle **only when its color matches the color shown at the top**.

- The game becomes harder over time with faster color changes and quicker response times.
- Each correct match increases your score.
- If you click the circle when the colors don't match or miss the circle, the game ends.
- Try to beat your high score and keep improving your reflexes!

## 🧩 Features

- Simple and intuitive gameplay
- Increasing difficulty over time
- Score tracking
- High score system

